        # registers was quadratic, hours in eliminate_dead_logic on the
        # XiangShan kit's 7.9M-cell tile. OpenSTA#482 (draft); retires at a
        # bump onto an OpenSTA that has it.
        # Extracted from //patches:0245-opensta-sdc-removal-reindex.patch
        "echo  | base64 -d | patch -p1 || (echo 'ERROR: Patch //patches:0245-opensta-sdc-removal-reindex.patch failed to apply to submodule. Please rebase the source of truth patch at //patches:0245-opensta-sdc-removal-reindex.patch.' && exit 1)",
        # Each filtered search ended with scans of every tag group, tag
